ease randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nXiaoliu and Xiaoming are good friends, they like mountain climbing and exploring. They plan a new outdoor activity. At this time, Xiaoliu thinks about whether to invite Xiaoyun, who likes mountain biking, to join the journey. Xiaoliu looks at Xiaoming, signals him to look at Xiaoyun with his eyes, and then shakes his head with a smile. Then, he throws an expectant look at Xiaoming, as if hinting at something. Xiaoming watches this process, seems to understand Xiaoliu's intention, so he decides to actively talk to Xiaoyun about this activity. Xiaoming and Xiaoyun talk for a few minutes, Xiaoyun hesitates at first, then nods.\n\n[Question]\nHow do you think Xiao Yun feels?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Xiao Yun hesitates at first, then happily participates in the outdoor activity.\nB. Xiao Yun feels lost because she is not directly invited to participate in the activity.\nC. Xiao Yun feels rejected because she sees Xiao Liu shake his head at Xiao Ming.\nD. Xiao Yun thinks she might be invited to their activity, feels excited.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.004069928526786877,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af52b29c2ddb05a7fe2fb9c","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794452265816,"createTime":"2026-11-12 10:57:45","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"cfd0e52798da4eb3b980a24d61dc20f4"}